WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:03.320
Ten independent air circuits. One rotating connection.

2
00:00:06.300 --> 00:00:08.060
Air on. The ribbon rises.

3
00:00:09.100 --> 00:00:12.909
Fixed housing. Rotating outlets. Air keeps flowing.

4
00:00:16.030 --> 00:00:17.870
Stopped. Still flowing.

5
00:00:18.150 --> 00:00:19.960
Air off. The ribbon falls.
